</simplesect>
Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">slt::SparseCOOMatrix&lt;float&gt;<sp/>coo(3,<sp/>3);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">coo.set(0,<sp/>0,<sp/>1.0f);</highlight></codeline>
